<h2>Description of the pins</h2>
<p>In the following description, 0 and 1 are used instead of =E2=80=9CLow=
=E2=80=9D and =E2=80=9CHigh=E2=80=9D.</p>
<div class=3D"table hscroll">
<table class=3D"framed">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th>Pin</th>
<th>Function</th>
<th>Description</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>1</td>
<td><span class=3D"overline">CE1</span></td>
<td>Chip enable 1, has be 0 together with <span class=3D"overline">CE2</spa=
n> to enable the inputs</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>3</td>
<td><span class=3D"overline">CE2</span></td>
<td>Chip enable 2</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>5</td>
<td><span class=3D"overline">CLR</span></td>
<td>Clear =E2=80=93 clears the content of the display</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>11</td>
<td>CUE</td>
<td>Cursor enable =E2=80=93 enables the cursor</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>10</td>
<td><span class=3D"overline">CU</span></td>
<td>Cursor select =E2=80=93 enables writing the cursor position</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>9</td>
